    "en": {
      "trackName": "Coin Slots Game",
      "description": "Slot machine \"One-armed bandit\" from the Wild West is just a great opportunity to escape from the tedious waiting in public transport and queues. Three types of coins, three different game strategies, three scenarios!\nNow the familiar game is not just at your fingertips (on a tablet and phone), but you can play it right on your smart watch!\nDownload now so as not to miss the release of the version with support for cooperative tournaments ;)",
      "releaseNotes": "This app has been updated by Apple to prepare for watchOS 27 compatibility. No new features are included.\n\nIn this version we:\n\nFixed several bugs\nAdded a request for user consent to process certain user data (in line with new GDPR requirements)\nOptimized the display of advertising banners\nIntegrated with the gaming community (now you can compete with both your friends and players from around the world)",
